    "question": "Let\n\\[\nf(x)=3x-4^{0.15x^2},\\qquad 0\\le x\\le3.\n\\]\n\n(a) Sketch the graph of \\(f\\) on the grid below. [3]\n\n![Blank coordinate grid for sketching f](images/QB000060_question_01_source.png)\n\n(b) Find the value of \\(x\\) for which \\(f'(x)=0\\). [2]",
