    "question": "The following table shows the data collected from an experiment.\n\n![Eight paired x and y observations](images/QB000163_question_01_source.png)\n\nThe data is also represented on the following scatter diagram.\n\n![Scatter diagram of the eight x and y observations](images/QB000163_question_02_source.png)\n\nThe relationship between \\(x\\) and \\(y\\) can be modelled by the regression line of \\(y\\) on \\(x\\) with equation \\(y=ax+b\\), where \\(a, b\\in R\\).\n\n(a) Write down the value of \\(a\\) and the value of \\(b\\). [2]\n\n(b) Use this model to predict the value of \\(y\\) when \\(x=18\\). [2]\n\n(c) Write down the value of \\(\\overline{x}\\) and the value of \\(\\overline{y}\\). [1]\n\n(d) Draw the line of best fit on the scatter diagram. [2]",
