    "answer": "(a) \\(\\boxed{a=0.433,\\ b=4.50}\\) (unrounded: \\(0.433156\\ldots,4.50265\\ldots\\)). A1A1\n\n[2 marks]\n\n(b) Substitute \\(x=18\\) into the regression equation. (M1)\n\nThis gives \\(y=12.2994\\ldots\\), so \\(\\boxed{y=12.3}\\). A1\n\n[2 marks]\n\n(c) \\(\\boxed{\\bar{x}=15,\\ \\bar{y}=11}\\). A1\n\n[1 mark]\n\n(d)\n\n![Scatter diagram with a straight regression line and the mean point marked](images/QB000163_answer_01_source.png)\n\nDraw the straight regression line through \\((15,11)\\), with the appropriate intercept, extending across the data range. A1A1\n\n> **Note:** Award A1 for a straight line through \\((15,11)\\). Award A1 for a line whose extended intercept is within \\(b\\pm1.5\\) and which covers the data range \\(3.3\\le x\\le25.3\\). Without a ruler, award at most A0A1.\n\n[2 marks]",
