    "question": "The number of hours spent exercising each week by a group of students is shown in the following table.\n\n![Exercise-time frequency table with an unknown frequency x](images/QB000171_question_01_source.png)\n\nThe median is \\(4.5\\) hours.\n\n(a) Find the value of \\(x\\). [2]\n\n(b) Find the standard deviation. [2]",
    "hint": "What does a median halfway between two exercise times imply about the cumulative frequencies? Which standard deviation output describes the entire recorded group?",
