    "answer": "uses \\(∑P(X=x)(=1)\\) (M1) \\({k}^{2}+(7k+2)+(-2k)+(3{k}^{2})(=1)\\) \\(4{k}^{2}+5k+1(=0)\\) A1 attempts to factorize their quadratic M1 \\((k+1)(4k+1)=0\\) \\(k=-1, -\\frac{1}{4}\\) A1 rejects \\(k=-1\\) as this value leads to invalid probabilities, for example, \\(P(X=2)=-5<0\\) R1 so \\(k=-\\frac{1}{4}\\) A1 Note: Award R0A1 if \\(k=-\\frac{1}{4}\\) is stated without a valid reason given for rejecting \\(k=-1\\). [6 marks]",
