    "question": "The following table below shows the marks scored by seven students on two different mathematics tests.\n\n![Table of travelling times for two tests.](images/QB000381_question_01_source.png)\n\nLet L1 be the regression line of x on y. The equation of the line L1 can be written in the form x = ay + b.\n\n(a) Find the value of a and the value of b. [2]\n\n(b) Let L2 be the regression line of y on x. The lines L1 and L2 pass through the same point with coordinates (p , q).\n\nFind the value of p and the value of q. [3]",
